                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <ref target="frus:frus1964-68v15">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1964–1968, Volume XV</ref>,
                    Germany and Berlin. Please be aware that printed volumes have not been revised.
                    <!--Revised information is in italic.-->
                </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#pg148">Document 66, Page 148</ref>
                            (date of correction: January 2, 2013)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The citation to “footnote 7” of <ref target="#d28">Document 28</ref> has
                        been corrected to read “footnote 6”.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
